description: Reservation domain rules for the 7Oz Espresso Cafe platform.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Reservation System

Reservations are one of the core business domains.

Every reservation must be treated as a business transaction.

Never implement reservation logic directly inside handlers or frontend components.

Always keep business rules inside the Service Layer.

---

# Reservation Flow

Reservation

↓

Availability Validation

↓

Capacity Validation

↓

Business Hours Validation

↓

Reservation Creation

↓

Confirmation

↓

Reminder (future)

↓

Customer Arrival (Checked In)

↓

Completed

---

# Reservation Status

Allowed statuses only:

PENDING

CONFIRMED

CHECKED_IN

COMPLETED

CANCELLED

NO_SHOW

Never create custom statuses without updating documentation.

---

# Guest Reservations

Guest reservations are supported in MVP.

An account is not required to book.

Required guest contact fields:

- Full name
- Email
- Phone

Authenticated customers may book while linked to their user account.

Rate-limit reservation submission to prevent abuse.

---

# Validation

Before creating a reservation always validate:

- Date
- Time
- Number of Guests
- Branch (future-ready; single branch for MVP)
- Table Availability / Capacity
- Business Hours
- Reservation Window
- Duplicate Reservation

---

# Capacity

Never allow reservations exceeding available capacity.

Prevent overbooking.

Always validate concurrent reservations.

---

# Time Slot

Reservation slots must be configurable.

Never hardcode time intervals.

Support future configuration from CMS/Admin.

---

# Business Hours

Reservation time must respect opening hours.

Closed days must reject reservations.

Holiday schedules must be future-ready.

---

# Customer Linkage

A reservation belongs to either:

- An authenticated customer account, or
- Guest contact details captured at booking time

Do not invent a fake user account for guests.

---

# Cancellation

Reservation cancellation should be configurable.

Support cancellation deadline.

Support cancellation reason.

---

# Audit

Every reservation action must be logged.

Create

Update

Cancel

Confirm

Check In

Complete

No Show

---

# Future Ready

Design for:

Multiple Branches

Table Assignment

Table Combination

Reservation Queue

SMS Reminder

WhatsApp Reminder

Email Reminder

Google Calendar Integration

POS Integration
